Comment: 0,0:01:57.69,0:02:02.78,OPJP,,0,0,0,,The distance between us bends all dimensions
Comment: 0,0:02:02.78,0:02:07.11,OPJP,,0,0,0,,Calling me, calling me, no transmissions
Comment: 0,0:02:07.11,0:02:08.20,OPJP,,0,0,0,,Say again!
Comment: 0,0:02:08.20,0:02:10.66,OPJP,,0,0,0,,奪ったり奪われたり　誰の為のREAL?
Comment: 0,0:02:10.66,0:02:12.91,OPJP,,0,0,0,,上がり下がりまくり　また嫌な夢
Comment: 0,0:02:12.91,0:02:15.08,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fs54}歪む。眩む目を開いて\N{\fs46}(what should I do...)
Comment: 0,0:02:15.08,0:02:18.25,OPJP,,0,0,0,,境目surviving　己を裁いてる
