Dialogue: 2,0:22:13.90,0:22:16.23,EDJP,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 2,0:22:26.83,0:22:29.87,EDJP,,0,0,0,,コンパスに導かれて
Dialogue: 2,0:22:29.87,0:22:31.50,EDJP,,0,0,0,,ゴールデンコンビ
Dialogue: 2,0:22:31.50,0:22:33.08,EDJP,,0,0,0,,僕らが登場
Dialogue: 2,0:22:33.08,0:22:34.54,EDJP,,0,0,0,,ハイパーマッチ
Dialogue: 2,0:22:34.54,0:22:36.42,EDJP,,0,0,0,,調子は最高潮
Dialogue: 2,0:22:36.42,0:22:39.67,EDJP,,0,0,0,,以心伝心 一挙公開
Dialogue: 2,0:22:39.67,0:22:42.92,EDJP,,0,0,0,,鬼神変人 いっちょどーだい？
Dialogue: 2,0:22:42.92,0:22:46.05,EDJP,,0,0,0,,最もBAD でも這い上がる猛獣キッズ
Dialogue: 2,0:22:46.05,0:22:49.22,EDJP,,0,0,0,,圧倒 What a パワー 込み上げる That's so sick!
Dialogue: 2,0:22:49.22,0:22:50.77,EDJP,,0,0,0,,おかわりちょーだい
Dialogue: 2,0:22:50.77,0:22:52.56,EDJP,,0,0,0,,華麗にSHOW TIME
Dialogue: 2,0:22:52.56,0:22:54.10,EDJP,,0,0,0,,スマイル豪快
Dialogue: 2,0:22:54.10,0:22:55.40,EDJP,,0,0,0,,僕らは超た・い・さ・く
Dialogue: 2,0:22:55.40,0:22:57.98,EDJP,,0,0,0,,Hey! Buddy
Dialogue: 2,0:22:57.98,0:22:58.52,EDJP,,0,0,0,,Move on!
Dialogue: 2,0:22:58.52,0:23:01.90,EDJP,,0,0,0,,バリバリBuddy, Yeah! 心踊れ
Dialogue: 2,0:23:01.90,0:23:05.07,EDJP,,0,0,0,,バリバリBuddy, Yeah! 熱く 高く
Dialogue: 2,0:23:05.07,0:23:08.53,EDJP,,0,0,0,,メラメラBuddy, Yeah! 炎灯せ
Dialogue: 2,0:23:08.53,0:23:11.49,EDJP,,0,0,0,,バリバリBuddy, Yeah! Rise up, with you!
Dialogue: 2,0:23:11.49,0:23:13.50,EDJP,,0,0,0,,僕らのストーリー
Dialogue: 2,0:23:13.50,0:23:14.66,EDJP,,0,0,0,,No limit でいけ
Dialogue: 2,0:23:14.66,0:23:16.42,EDJP,,0,0,0,,Going Going Going
Dialogue: 2,0:23:16.42,0:23:21.13,EDJP,,0,0,0,,2人だけの世界抱きしめ
Dialogue: 2,0:23:21.13,0:23:23.05,EDJP,,0,0,0,,Burning Burning Burning
Dialogue: 2,0:23:23.05,0:23:24.34,EDJP,,0,0,0,,未来へ
